    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Depth-first, forward traversal for all event types.</para><para>This traversal follows edges in their natural order from source to target visiting children before siblings. The advancing methods and operators stop at the next event that matches a list of significant event types supplied as a constructor argument.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1Algorithm_1_1GraphTraversal" kindref="compound">GraphTraversal</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
